  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "All the arrangements, with or without meaning, of the word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FARMER</mi></math> are written excluding any word that has two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> appearing together. The arrangements are listed serially in the alphabetic order as in the English dictionary. Then the serial number of the word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FARMER</mi></math> in this list is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "77",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Number of such words&nbsp;without both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> together</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;total possible words - total possible words with both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;together</p><p>Number of such words start with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>Number of such words start with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>Number of such words start with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FAE</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Number of such words start with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FAM</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Number of such words start with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FARE</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Number of such words start with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FARMER</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Total <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>77</mn></math></p>",
